+
+## What was done
+
+Added `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It returns `{ bookingId, refund }`, removes the
+booking so its item is free again, and throws for an unknown or already cancelled booking and for an `at`
+that is not a UTC ISO-8601 time. Refund policy: see dl-005. Tests added in `test/rental.test.ts` (red
+first, then green).
